        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88TR6, Solid Brass 88 Series Towel Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCrafted out of solid brass, the 88 Series Towel Ring is will look great in both contemporary and traditional decors.  It is large enough for full-sized towels but not so bulky that hand towels would look out of place hanging from it. It is available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes. This bathroom towel ring is made with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88TR6-specifications.gif?v=1704354620\" width=\"600\" height=\"244\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88TR6 Towel Ring Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Ring:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88TR6.pdf?v=1691095361\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88TR6 Towel Ring Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel ring, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
